# 4 major Domains

## Spaceship command

- Ship System Control
   1. Destroyer Control
   2. Destroyer System Management
   3. Light Cruiser Control
   4. Light Cruiser System Management
   5. Heavy Cruiser Control
   6. Heavy Cruiser System Management
   ... All other level of ships
- Navigation: 10 levels, each level increase 1% of the ship speed
- Scanning: 10 levels, enable user to scan the universe and scout enemy, enable user to lock on enemy ship.
- Engineering
   1. Maintanence: 10 levels, the higher the skill, the better repairments rate.
   2. Energy Shields: 10 levels, the higher the skill, the faster recharge rate.
   3. Damage Control: 10 levels, higher level improve higher chance of deal with critical damages like: hull breach, reactor fire, reactor failure, bridge failure, computer system failure ... 
   4. Electronics: 10 levels, increase the effectiveness of the electronic systems of a ship
- Weaponry
   1. Ballistic Weapon: 10 levels, below level 5, the weapon will suffer 50% of damage and accuracy debuff, after level 5, each level will increase 5% of effectiveness.
   2. Energy Weapon: 10 levels, below level 5, the weapon will suffer 50% of damage and accuracy debuff, after level 5, each level will increase 5% of effectiveness.
   3. Missiles: 10 levels, below level 5, the weapon will suffer 50% of damage and accuracy debuff, after level 5, each level will increase 5% of effectiveness.
   4. Drones: 10 levels, below level 5, the weapon will suffer 50% of damage and accuracy debuff, after level 5, each level will increase 5% of effectiveness.
- Fleet Command
   1. Formation drill: 10 levels, reach level 5 will enable second ship, 7 enable third ship, 8 enable fourth, 10 enable all five ships in the fleet
   2. Attacking Formation: 10 levels, each level increase 1% overall effectiveness of accuracy, damage, navigation, weapon tracking of all ships in the fleet
   3. Defensive Formation: 10 levels, each level increase 1% overall effectiveness of Mainanence, Energy Shield, Damage Control, Damage Reduction, Damage Evision of all ships in the fleet
   4. Mining Operation Formation: 10 levels, each level increase 2% overall effectiveness of mining operations of all ship
   5. Regroup and hold: 10 levels, each level will help bring all remainning ship in a fleet to regroup(fleet may be disrupted when heavy damage has been implicted, in disruption, ships will lose bouns of fleet related)
   6. Fighter squadron control: 10 levels, each level will increase effectiveness of Fighter / Boomer Squadron, increase speed, accuracy, evision of fighter squadrons

